,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T19:35:30Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T10:59:22Z","body":"Yes, but these's no full PCK compatibility even of format is the same, it is checking for the engine version used to create PCK when loading it.\r\n\r\nEdit: Added compatibility for loading old format PCKs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831284531/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832209137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105757#issuecomment-2832209137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105757","id":2832209137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o0BTx","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T13:42:55Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T13:42:55Z","body":"PCK format history, for the reference:\r\n\r\n### Version 0 and 1 (no difference in format):\r\n```\r\n    Header:\r\n        uint32                  Magic GDPC (0x43504447).\r\n        uint32                  PCK version (0 or 1).\r\n        3 * uint32              Engine version.\r\n        16 * uint32             Reserved.\r\n    Directory:\r\n        uint32                  File count.\r\n    Directory record (right after header, \"file count\" records):\r\n        uint32                  Name length.\r\n        \"name len\" * char8      Name, UTF-8 encoded, padded with zeros.\r\n        uint64                  File offset (absolute offset in the file).\r\n        uint64                  File size.\r\n        16 * uint8              MD5 checksum.\r\n    ...\r\n        (file data)\r\n```\r\n### Version 2 (encryption support added, relative file base added later without changing version):\r\n```\r\n    Header:\r\n        uint32                  Magic GDPC (0x43504447).\r\n        uint32                  PCK version (2).\r\n        3 * uint32              Engine version.\r\n        uint32                  Flags: bit 0 - encrypted, bit 1 - relative filebase.\r\n        uint64                  File base offset (if \"relative filebase\" it is relative to the Magic, otherwise absolute offset in the file).\r\n        16 * uint32             Reserved.\r\n    Directory:\r\n        uint32                  File count.\r\n    Directory record (right after header, \"file count\" records):\r\n        uint32                  Name length.\r\n        \"name len\" * char8      Name, UTF-8 encoded, padded with zeros.\r\n        uint64                  File offset (relative to \"file base offset\").\r\n        uint64                  File size.\r\n        16 * uint8              MD5 checksum.\r\n        uint32                  File flags: bit 0 - encrypted, bit 1 - deleted file.\r\n    ...\r\n        (file data)\r\n```\r\n### Version 3 (this PR):\r\n```\r\n    Header:\r\n        uint32                  Magic GDPC (0x43504447).\r\n        uint32                  PCK version (3).\r\n        3 * uint32              Engine version.\r\n        uint32                  Flags: bit 0 - encrypted.\r\n        uint64                  File base offset (relative to the Magic).\r\n        uint64                  Directory offset (relative to the Magic).\r\n        16 * uint32             Reserved.\r\n    ...\r\n        (file data)\r\n    ...\r\n    Directory (at \"directory offset\", \"file count\" records):\r\n        uint32                  File count.\r\n    Directory record:\r\n        uint32                  Name length.\r\n        \"name len\" * char8      Name, UTF-8 encoded, padded with zeros.\r\n        uint64                  File offset (relative to \"file base offset\").\r\n        uint64                  File size.\r\n        16 * uint8              MD5 checksum.\r\n        uint32                  File flags: bit 0 - encrypted, bit 1 - deleted file.\r\n    ...\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832209137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2929687867","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105757#issuecomment-2929687867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105757","id":2929687867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6un307","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T09:34:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T09:34:17Z","body":">         16 * uint32             Reserved.\r\n\r\nI'm wondering what is this reserved for, if not the additions we've made in version 2 and now 3?\r\n\r\nWasn't the idea that this buffer would be used to pack more metadata in the header without affecting the directory offset?\r\nAnyway with this change it wouldn't be relevant as the directory offset is no longer constant.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2929687867/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2929718001","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105757#issuecomment-2929718001","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105757","id":2929718001,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6un_Lx","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T09:41:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T09:41:38Z","body":"> I'm wondering what is this reserved for, if not the additions we've made in version 2 and now 3?\r\n\r\nIt would make sense to use this reserved space for extra metadata that is not breaking compatibility (without version change). I think it was never used for this purpose.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2929718001/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932937559","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105757#issuecomment-2932937559","issue_url":"https://a